# copr:avengemedia/dms and copr:avengemedia/danklinux.
# These float permanently: COPR prunes superseded builds, so versionlock to an
# older NEVRA is impossible. The manifest diff in CI is the bisectability
# substitute -- see repos/ for the includepkgs fencing.
dms
dms-cli
dms-greeter
quickshell
dgop
danksearch                  # ships /usr/bin/dsearch and dsearch.service; the unit is NOT named danksearch.service
matugen
# cpptrace is pulled in by quickshell (libcpptrace.so.1) and must stay inside
# the danklinux includepkgs allowlist or the install fails.
